# Frontend — NO environment variables are required.
#
# Contract addresses are compiled into lib/generated.ts, the iExec Nox gateway and
# subgraph are resolved by the SDK from the chain id, and reads fall back across
# several public Sepolia endpoints. Deploy to Vercel with an empty environment.
#
# The single optional variable, for heavy traffic only:
#   SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=https://eth-sepolia.g.alchemy.com/v2/KEY
# Set it WITHOUT the NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix so it stays server-side and the key is
# never shipped to the browser (the app routes reads through /api/rpc).
